getrandom 0.3, which rand 0.9 takes its seed from for Smithay, takes
random bytes from getentropy on Radix, which mlibc has, as it does on
OpenBSD, with the libc crate it needs for that, and finds errno through
__errno_location: what the patch of getrandom 0.4 does.

